on-pre-ipo-round\",\"title\":\"Kalshi Nears $40 Billion Valuation in Last Round Before IPO\",\"dek\":\"Sequoia and Wellington are in talks to lead a round that would nearly quadruple Kalshi's December price, while New York seeks at least $36 billion from the company in court.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Kalshi Nears $40 Billion Valuation in Last Round Before IPO\",\"width\":2400,\"height\":1200,\"card\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2-800x400.jpg\",\"feature\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2-1600x800.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2-256x256.jpg\"},\"category\":{\"name\":\"Prediction Markets\",\"slug\":\"prediction-markets\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Francis Gable\",\"slug\":\"francis-gable\",\"avatarUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"bio\":\"Francis Gable covers the gambling industry as it happens, tracking everything from licensing decisions and legal changes to acquisitions, launches and major operator news.\",\"x\":null,\"linkedin\":null},\"authors\":[\"$3f:props:stories:9:author\"],\"body\":\"$undefined\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-01T11:54:25.591Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-01T11:54:25.601Z\",\"isBreaking\":false,\"breakingAt\":\"$undefined\",\"breakingDurationHours\":8,\"badge\":\"auto\",\"tags\":[],\"topics\":[],\"verified\":false,\"responsibleGambling\":true,\"pickOrder\":null,\"readingMinutes\":2,\"seo\":{\"metaTitle\":null,\"metaDescription\":null},\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Kalshi Nears $40 Billion Valuation in Final Pre-IPO Round\",\"description\":\"Kalshi is finalizing a round at about $40 billion, Bloomberg reports, nearly four times its December value as state lawsuits pile up.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Kalshi Nears $40 Billion Valuation in Last Round Before IPO\",\"width\":2400,\"height\":1200,\"card\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2-800x400.jpg\",\"feature\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2-1600x800.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/kalshi-40-billion-valuation-pre-ipo-round-cover-2-256x256.jpg\"}},\"level\":\"$undefined\",\"kind\":\"$undefined\"},{\"id\":223,\"collection\":\"news-posts\",\"slug\":\"softswiss-2027-igaming-trends-crypto-faded-comeback\",\"title\":\"SoftSwiss Calls Crypto a Fad, Then Forecasts a 2027 Crypto Casino Boom\",\"dek\":\"The casino software maker's five-year review files crypto under payments and compliance. Fifty-eight pages later, the same report says crypto casinos may enter a new cycle in 2027.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/softswiss-2027-igaming-trends-crypto-faded-comeback-cover-2.jpg\",\"alt\":\"SoftSwiss Calls Crypto a Fad, Then Forecasts a 2027 Crypto Casino Boom\",\"width\":2400,\"height\":1200,\"card\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/softswiss-2027-igaming-trends-crypto-faded-comeback-cover-2-800x400.jpg\",\"feature\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/softswiss-2027-igaming-trends-crypto-faded-comeback-cover-2-1600x800.jpg\",\"avatar\":\"https://cdn.fairgambling.com/news/softswiss-2027-igaming-trends-crypto-faded-comeback-cover-2-256x256.jpg\"},\"category\":{\"name\":\"Crypto Casinos\",\"slug\":\"crypto-casinos\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Francis Gable\",\"slug\":\"francis-gable\",\"avatarUrl\":\"$undefined\",\"bio\":\"Francis Gable covers the gambling industry as it happens, tracking everything from licensing decisions and legal changes to acquisitions, launches and major operator news.\",\"x\":null,\"linkedin\":null},\"authors\":[\"$3f:props:stories:10:author\"],\"body\":\"$undefined\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-01T11:43:27.154Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-01T11:43:27.166Z\",\"isB